## What was done

**Preset catalog** (`adblockpresets.{h,cpp}` + `adblockpresetsdialog.{h,cpp}`): "Preset Filter Lists…" in the AdBlock dialog's action menu shows 18 verified-live lists grouped into Core & Privacy, Annoyances, Security, Resource Abuse & Mining, and Regional — uAssets lists, EasyList Annoyances/Cookie Notices/Social, maintained NoCoin anti-miner, uBO badware + URLhaus + phishing-filter security lists, and DE/FR/RU/CS-SK/LT regional lists.

**Opt-in mechanics**: ticking calls `AdBlockManager::subscribeRemoteList` (dedupes by list URL, re-enables disabled subscriptions, grants TELEM01 remote-list consent, kicks fetch); unticking disables. Opening the dialog alone grants/fetches nothing.

