## What landed

- **Search settings page, Vivaldi-style**: three engine selectors up front — default, private-window (private/Tor windows search through it, falling back to default), and image-search (drives the new "Search Image with…" context-menu entry; only capable engines listed).
- **Image search as a real capability**: `purpose="image"` `<Url>` endpoint on `OpenSearchEngine`, with reader/writer round-trip including image POST params; bundled DuckDuckGo, Google and Yahoo! descriptors gained endpoints.
- **Field display modes**: Text Field / Button radios share SRCH03's `showSearchBox` key — button mode collapses `ToolbarSearch` to its engine button, and the engines menu is now a non-modal `popup()` (the modal `exec()` hung tests offscreen).
- **New persisted prefs**: nickname-in-dropdown, engine icon, always-new-tab, keep-last-selected field engine, keep-typed-text, selection-search-in-background.
- **Per-context suggestion toggles**: address field / search field / only-with-nickname, layered on the existing per-engine opt-in.
- **Upgrade fix**: `load()` merges missing bundled descriptors into existing profiles (with a `removedBundledEngines` blocklist), and Restore Defaults truly refreshes same-named engines — this is how existing installs pick up the new endpoints and the DDG default.
- **Honest skips**: speed dial (doesn't exist) and extension control (needs security review), noted on the row.

